{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふにゃふにゃー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかね、わたしずっとガールズルールの衣装のっけてなかったね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これじゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/06/28/4910564/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グリーンのチーム松村の形！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしはこの衣装をキャベツとよんでおる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/06/28/4910564/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬！今度にらめっこしてみる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにずーさんとにらめっこすると、10メートル先のトイレまで聞こえるくらい引き笑いしてくれる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、うまズキッ！の歌収録してきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の土曜日フジテレビ系で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"25:05～25:30に放送します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"29日土曜日に、TBS系で音楽の日という番組に生放送で出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両方チェック頼むぜべいべっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/06/28/4910564/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当最近髪の毛長くしてから、清楚ガールに見られる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、正直嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この調子で乃木坂の清楚担当目指す！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黙りまーすε=ε=ε=ε=ε=ε=┌(;￣◇￣)┘笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返すーーーーーーん！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみがBIGBANGの曲の中で何が好き⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンタスティックベイビー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハルハル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果、豚足は食べたの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べない！あれは、無理や！！！笑\n形モロじゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまあみは本とか読む？\n読んでたら、おすすめを教えてほしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間までは悪の経典読んでたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだスマホにしたんだけど\nおすすめのアプリってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウィンドランナーは楽しいよ(#^.^#)\nあとねぇ、ロードムービーズ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生がはってきたけど感想はいかに？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーー、負けないよーー！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは、鳥さんの糞の\n直撃を食らったことないかぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーない！！！\nあるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンデーションなに使ってる？？？\nま、まさかファンデなしでその肌？！\nよかったら教えてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"KATEのとろとろファンデーション！\nテカりにくくてオススメ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみはレコーディングや舞台で喉を沢山使うことが多いと思うけど、\n普段どんなケアしてる？\nずっと喉が痛いのだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊急のときは、ネギ超絶たっぷりの料理食べ、タオルとかあったかいの喉に巻く！\nあとハチミツ飲む！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやったらお金って逃げませんかね？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめん、わからん。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"t